{"seq":2,"ts":"2026-11-23T18:46:48.932159+00:00","type":"message","payload":{"role":"user","content":"A loan of $250,000 is repaid over 30 years with monthly payments at a fixed annual interest\nrate of 6% (compounded monthly).\n\nCompute the fixed monthly payment, rounded to 2 decimal places, and write ONLY the numeric\nvalue (e.g. `1234.56`) to `/workspace/payment.txt`."}}
